# LPG Cylinder Tracker — environment template
#
# This app is local-first: it needs NO secrets, NO API keys and NO backend.
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) only if you need to override a build path.
#
# Base path for the built site. Use "/" for Codespaces / Netlify / Vercel,
# or "/<repo-name>/" when deploying to GitHub Pages.
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/

# NEVER put API keys, tokens, passwords or household data in this file or in
# any .env file that is committed. See README > Privacy & security.
